## .distignore — files excluded from the distributed plugin ZIP.
## Mirrors the `-x` exclude list in .github/workflows/update-release-latest.yml
## (the zip step is the actual gate; this file documents the contract and
## is what `wp dist-archive` / `svn` tooling would use).
##
## Plugin updates are handled by the WordPress.org plugin directory once
## the plugin is approved (no in-plugin updater is bundled). Before
## approval, operators install/update by uploading the GitHub release ZIP
## via WP Admin. The previous `update-checker.php` self-updater was
## removed in v1.47 because plugin-check (correctly) rejects in-plugin
## update mechanisms for WordPress.org submissions.

# Development tests (have CLI-only guards and phpcs:disable; not for end users).
tests/

# Editor / metadata noise.
.distignore
.editorconfig
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Build / dev folders.
node_modules/
vendor/
phpcs.xml.dist

# WordPress.org plugin directory marketing images (banners/icons/screenshots)
# live in the SVN top-level `/assets` folder — managed manually, not in this
# plugin tree and not by publish-wp-org-plugin.yml. If any are ever dropped at
# the plugin root for convenience, the zip/SVN trunk builders strip them so they
# never ship inside the installable plugin (keeps download size small).
# Do not confuse with `assets/` below (plugin CSS/JS/img — those DO ship).
screenshot-1.png
screenshot-2.png
screenshot-3.png
screenshot-*.png
screenshot-*.jpg
screenshot-*.jpeg
screenshot-*.gif

# Same: directory marketing banners/icons at plugin root only (not assets/).
banner-*.png
banner-*.jpg
icon-*.png
icon-*.jpg
